  <p>
    Sporting a UC Jacket and some of our new Site Pants, we paid the Upper East Side a visit. Normally finding ourselves there to check out the museums or kick around Central Park, we always enjoy taking a walk in the neighborhood. 
    The awnings that jut out from the apartments, the properly dressed elderly, the classical architecture; it all comes together to feel like the New York we know from the movies.  
  </p> 
