<div class="centered-article-text">
  <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto;">
	High quality, large head, locking YKK reverse coil zippers secure the center front opening of the jackets and the hand pockets. 
    Reverse coil zips minimize the chunky aesthetic sometimes created by large format Vislon and Coil zips. 
    Inside the jacket is a substantial four way stretch liner fabric that wicks moisture and provides a comfortable layer between the jacket and your body. 
    With temperatures starting to dip, the UC Jacket works well for a morning jog or a trip to the local bodega. 
  </p>
</div>


